      "material": [
        {
          "id": "h5",
          "type": "heading",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "My first trip to Hollywood, USA"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "p5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "em",
              "v": "Jelica Shaw talks about a family holiday to Los Angeles"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "This summer, my parents and I had a holiday in Hollywood, an area in Los Angeles famous for its filmmaking. My mum and dad are journalists and sometimes work there, so they know the city really well."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Our hotel was near the Hollywood Walk of Fame, a famous pavement that has over 2,600 metal stars with the names of famous actors and singers on them. It’s very popular with visitors. We walked along it every day, and I’m glad about that, as there were so many names to read!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The second day, we went on a tour at Universal Studios. This is a film studio where famous actors work, and it also has some exciting rides. The rides were good, but visiting the places where movies such as "
            },
            {
              "t": "em",
              "v": "Jurassic Park"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " were made was my favourite part of the tour."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "On the third day, we went on the Rodeo Drive Tour. It’s a bus tour to see famous people’s houses. Actually, most of the homes were a really long way from the road or behind trees or gates, which is a pity. But the guide was so funny that I still enjoyed myself and the time went by very quickly."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "For our final night, we watched a film at an outdoor theatre called the Hollywood Bowl. "
            },
            {
              "t": "em",
              "v": "The Sound of Music"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " is my dad’s favourite film so I know the story and songs quite well, but I couldn’t believe 17,500 other people wanted to watch it too. I had no idea it was so popular! It was certainly an experience I’ll never forget."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q14",
          "number": 14,
          "points": 1,
          "skills": [
            "inference"
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "choice",
            "variant": "standard",
            "maxChoices": 1,
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "What do we learn about Jelica’s parents in the first paragraph?"
              }
            ],
            "options": [
              {
                "id": "A",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "They have been to Hollywood many times."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "B",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
                    "v": "They don’t have a summer holiday every year."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "C",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "t": "text",
