              "t": "text",
              "v": "When he was only 11, Mark began earning money for his family. He worked in a printing company and wrote articles for the local newspaper, but what he really wanted to do was to "
            },
            {
              "t": "blank",
              "id": "b22",
              "number": 22
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " a river boat captain. He studied "
            },
            {
              "t": "blank",
              "id": "b23",
              "number": 23
